{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113855","id":3090181077,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc64MGvV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113855","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113855.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113855.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113855","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113855/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113855/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113855/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bf02ce10815f33070e56c6e095e3253340765e8a","number":113855,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Keep `ScriptEditor` history when closing tabs","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When closing a tab while not at the end of the history all entries after the current idx are deleted. This PRs goal is to ensure that the rest of the history is kept and working. Files are reopened if needed when the history idx changes to them, files which are deleted from the system are removed from the history.\r\n\r\n~Note: There currently is an issue with the history when working with script files (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113619). So I only used files from the internal documentation for testing this~\r\n\r\n## Example\r\n\r\n```\r\n------- history -----\r\n0 :  AABB\r\n1 :  float <--- this is closed\r\n2 :  ClassDB\r\n3 :  bool\r\ncurr idx:  1\r\n```\r\n## Closing `1: float`\r\n\r\n### Without PR\r\n```\r\n------- history -----\r\n0 :  AABB\r\ncurr idx:  0\r\n```\r\n\r\n### With PR\r\n```\r\n------- history -----\r\n0 :  AABB\r\n1 :  float <--- tab is closed and will reopen when moving to its index in the history or be removed when the source no longer exists\r\n1 :  ClassDB\r\n2 :  bool\r\ncurr idx:  0\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url"